      "role": "user",
      "content": "the coin thing makes sense but it still sounds a bit like magic. i read somewhere that einstein called it \"spooky action at a distance.\" why did he call it spooky? like is there something actually unsettling about how it works or is he just being dramatic?",
      "source": "evaluator"
